msgid "Detection"
msgstr "检测设置"

msgid "How the background daemon probes every target."
msgstr "后台守护进程对每个目标使用的探测方式。"

msgid "Enable monitoring"
msgstr "启用监控"

msgid "Master switch. When disabled the background daemon stops probing."
msgstr "总开关。关闭后后台服务停止探测。"

msgid "Default probe method"
msgstr "默认探测方式"

msgid "ICMP echo (ping) by default. TCP connect measures the TCP handshake time to a port and still works on networks that drop ICMP. A target can override this."
msgstr "默认使用 ICMP echo（ping）。TCP 连接方式测量到指定端口的 TCP 握手耗时，在被丢弃 ICMP 的网络里依然可用。单个目标可单独覆盖此项。"

msgid "ICMP (ping)"
msgstr "ICMP（ping）"

msgid "TCP connect"
msgstr "TCP 连接"

msgid "Default TCP port"
msgstr "默认 TCP 端口"

msgid "Used by TCP targets that do not specify a port of their own. Allowed range 1-65535."
msgstr "供未单独指定端口的目标使用，允许范围 1-65535。"

msgid "Check interval (seconds)"
msgstr "检测间隔（秒）"

msgid "Recommended values: 1, 5, 10, 15, 30, 60, 120, 300. Allowed range 1-3600."
msgstr "推荐值：1、5、10、15、30、60、120、300。允许范围 1-3600。"

msgid "Probe timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "Ping 超时（秒）"

msgid "Per-packet wait time before a probe is considered lost."
msgstr "单个探测包的等待时间，超时即判定为丢包。"

msgid "Packets per probe"
msgstr "每次检测发包数"

msgid "ICMP only. Higher values give better loss statistics but cost more time. TCP always performs a single connect."
msgstr "仅对 ICMP 有效。数值越大丢包统计越准，但耗时更长；TCP 方式固定只建立一次连接。"

msgid "Concurrent probes"
msgstr "并发检测数量"

msgid "Maximum number of targets probed in parallel."
msgstr "同时进行探测的目标数量上限。"

msgid "Which protocol family the probes use. A target can override this."
msgstr "探测使用的协议族，单个目标可单独覆盖。"

msgid "Auto"
msgstr "自动"

msgid "IPv4 only"
msgstr "仅 IPv4"

msgid "IPv6 only"
msgstr "仅 IPv6"

msgid "Outbound interface (optional)"
msgstr "出口接口（可选）"

msgid "Example: wan, wwan. Leave empty to use the system default route."
msgstr "例如 wan、wwan。留空则使用系统默认路由。"

msgid "Source address (optional)"
msgstr "源地址（可选）"

msgid "Bind probes to a specific source IP address."
msgstr "将探测绑定到指定的源 IP 地址。"

msgid "Data retention"
msgstr "数据保留"

msgid "Where samples are kept and how long they survive."
msgstr "采样数据的存放位置与保留时长。"

msgid "Write aggregated samples to flash periodically. Disabled by default to protect flash lifetime."
msgstr "定期将聚合数据写入 Flash。默认关闭以保护 Flash 寿命。"

msgid "History retention"
msgstr "历史保留时间"

msgid "How long aggregated samples are kept on flash when persistence is enabled."
msgstr "开启持久化后，聚合数据在 Flash 上的保留时长。"

msgid "1 hour"
msgstr "最近 1 小时"

msgid "6 hours"
msgstr "最近 6 小时"

msgid "12 hours"
msgstr "最近 12 小时"

msgid "24 hours"
msgstr "最近 24 小时"

msgid "3 days"
msgstr "最近 3 天"

msgid "7 days"
msgstr "最近 7 天"

msgid "30 days"
msgstr "最近 30 天"

msgid "Flush interval (seconds)"
msgstr "落盘间隔（秒）"

msgid "How often aggregated data is written to flash. Larger values mean fewer writes."
msgstr "聚合数据写入 Flash 的频率，数值越大写入次数越少。"

msgid "In-memory samples per target"
msgstr "每目标内存采样点数"

msgid "Ring buffer size in tmpfs. 4320 samples at a 10s interval covers about 12 hours."
msgstr "tmpfs 中环形缓存的大小。10 秒间隔下 4320 点约覆盖 12 小时。"

msgid "Thresholds"
msgstr "阈值"

msgid "Values used to turn raw measurements into a quality grade."
msgstr "把原始测量值换算为质量等级所用的阈值。"

msgid "Excellent below (ms)"
msgstr "优秀（低于，毫秒）"

msgid "Latency below this value is graded Excellent."
msgstr "延迟低于该值判为「优秀」。"

msgid "Good below (ms)"
msgstr "良好（低于，毫秒）"

msgid "Latency below this value is graded Good."
msgstr "延迟低于该值判为「良好」。"

msgid "Fair below (ms)"
msgstr "一般（低于，毫秒）"

msgid "Latency below this value is graded Fair."
msgstr "延迟低于该值判为「一般」。"

msgid "Poor below (ms)"
msgstr "较差（低于，毫秒）"

msgid "Latency at or above this value is graded Severe."
msgstr "延迟达到或超过该值判为「严重」。"

msgid "Loss warning (%)"
msgstr "丢包告警阈值（%）"

msgid "Packet loss at or above this percentage is considered a warning."
msgstr "丢包率达到或超过该百分比时视为告警。"

msgid "Loss critical (%)"
msgstr "丢包严重阈值（%）"

msgid "Packet loss at or above this percentage is considered critical."
msgstr "丢包率达到或超过该百分比时视为严重。"

msgid "Consecutive failures to warn"
msgstr "连续失败告警阈值"

msgid "After this many consecutive failures the target is graded Severe."
msgstr "连续失败达到该次数后，目标判为「严重」。"

msgid "Consecutive failures to critical"
msgstr "连续失败严重阈值"

msgid "After this many consecutive failures the target is graded Offline."
msgstr "连续失败达到该次数后，目标判为「离线」。"

msgid "Interface & logging"
msgstr "界面与日志"

msgid "Front-end refresh rate and log verbosity."
msgstr "前端刷新频率与日志详细程度。"

msgid "UI refresh interval (seconds)"
msgstr "界面刷新间隔（秒）"

msgid "How often the page fetches new state. Independent from the probe interval."
msgstr "页面获取最新状态的频率，与检测间隔相互独立。"

msgid "Log level"
msgstr "日志级别"

msgid "Normal probes are never logged. Only state changes and failures produce log entries."
msgstr "正常探测不写日志，只在状态变化和失败时记录。"

